From 5a5062d7f544b5643cae9e673b5b035fbc6e9c89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 24/60] xhttp: the client of Xray's XHTTP transport

The XHTTP transport of Xray for the client: packet-up, stream-up and stream-one over HTTP/1.1,
HTTP/2 and HTTP/3, the download leg, BBR and the Chrome QUIC profile over HTTP/3, the backoff, the
option schema.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  75578923f xhttp: add the client of Xray's XHTTP transport
  e2e6496b4 xhttp: tests for options, configuration errors, the download leg and HTTP/3; refuse VLESS flow over xhttp
  b03cd1e75 xhttp: a small default request size for uploads carried in headers or cookies
  d33bc96ec xhttp: cap the frame size the HTTP/2 client writes, wait for data on a small probe, retire idle pooled connections
  f137d8a7c xhttp: test the backoff against a server that resets every upload
  73d03ff0d xhttp: do not cancel packet-up uploads with their session
  ccc73d44e xhttp: the transport in the option schema
  a2df8fa66 xhttp: BBR congestion control and the Chrome QUIC profile over HTTP/3, as Xray
  e58dfdde8 xhttp: fixes from the review
  64dc2bd6e xhttp: an oversized request no longer takes the connection down
  42087b587 xhttp: data written before a close is sent
  466151538 xhttp: the backoff holds back connections, not sessions
  1370c392c xhttp: a graceful GOAWAY is not a failure of the server
  2e8c9e848 xhttp: HTTP/3 takes another connection when one is out of streams
  5e6b2e85b xhttp: no post interval for a range from zero; tests for rotation and deadlines
  f60ab8ee6 xhttp: no time limit on an upload a watched connection carries
  6acee51bc xhttp: fixes from the second review
  b3781bc99 xhttp: Close resets the transport instead of ending it
  0a504852b xhttp: browser versions survive a clock that was never set
  cf3e1dc59 xhttp: refuse an uplink_http_method that is not a token
  876a44140 xhttp: one check of the options, and a download server needs its port
  b3a202a3a xhttp: the test of oversized upload headers no longer races the server's settings
  637ae625f xhttp: a write after the server ended the upload is the end of the connection
  48c08fec7 xhttp: the idle connections of the pool are closed on request

Pdk-Feature: xhttp
Pdk-Zone: protocols
Pdk-Layer: 03
